// A parameterised const declared to return a unit hands the unit back. It used
// to drop it - the constfn symbol never stored returnUnit and resolveCall's
// return cast left toUnit out - so every caller of a `const px f(...)` needed
// the cast the declaration had already written. Found during §76's build.
unit px = u16
const px f( u16 v ) = px( v )
px x = f( 3 )
u16 out = u16( x )
